  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Hall talk treats the Gu as hard to come by for any strength path Gu Immortal. For Fang Yuan as an immortal zombie with a dead aperture, the dao mark growth offsets stagnant cultivation when he cannot undergo tribulations, though the offset is slight next to passing tribulations.",
        "chapters": [
          758
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After recent use, Fang Yuan counts a little over forty strength path dao marks added by the Gu, with his body still under two hundred in total.",
        "chapters": [
          852
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan simplifies vaguely familiar face so Eat Strength is its only core Immortal Gu. That version cannot change appearance, but it can change regional aura by spending strength path dao marks, turning a Northern Plains Gu Immortal aura into that of another region when the observer is not skilled in investigation.",
        "chapters": [
          836
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_northern_plains"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Much later, Fang Yuan compares Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable’s food path methods that raise dao marks after tasting tea or wine with what Eat Strength could do, and notes that the Immortal Gu is unique while those killer moves can be learned and spread.",
        "chapters": [
          2083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
